    <!-- Article 3 -->
    <item>
        <title>Motion Informatics Partners with European Health Consortium</title>
        <link>https://yourdomain.com/news/european-health-consortium</link>
        <pubDate>Wed, 28 Feb 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Motion Informatics is proud to announce a landmark multi-year partnership with the European Health Consortium to bring advanced informatics to over 40 rehabilitation centers across 5 countries.</p><p>This agreement, spanning France, Germany, the Netherlands, Spain, and Sweden, will introduce the STIMEL-03 and Spatial StimelMD platforms to approximately 28,000 patients annually.</p><h2>Partnership Details</h2><p>Under the terms of the agreement, Motion Informatics will provide full clinical training, ongoing software updates, and dedicated technical support for all consortium member facilities.</p>]]></content:encoded>
        <excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[A multi-year partnership to bring advanced informatics to over 40 rehabilitation centers across 5 countries in Europe.]]></excerpt:encoded>
